/**
 * TRIPLE-NEGATIVE BREAST CANCER: registry-only trial records. Every interventional phase 2, 2/3 or 3 trial on
 * ClinicalTrials.gov that on 2026-09-24 was recruiting, not yet recruiting or enrolling by invitation (plus the phase 3
 * and 2/3 trials that are active but closed to recruitment), names triple-negative breast cancer in its title or
 * conditions, and was not already in the corpus. Generated from the v2 API snapshot cached under /tmp/tnbc by the TNBC
 * deep dive; registry facts only, no outcomes. Trials with results and the UK-led trials are hand-written in
 * ./tnbc-treatment.ts. UK sites are quoted in `notes`. Linked from the glossary term `tnbc-trials-open-today` so none
 * is an orphan. Records link to the early or metastatic subtype page, not to `tnbc` itself, so the cancer page stays under
 * its markup ceiling (src/app/record-fold.test.ts); the term lists all of them. Trials with HER2-positive or hormone
 * receptor-positive cohorts alongside a triple-negative one are left out.
 */
